WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.667
Toad threw himself on the floor of the jail.

2
00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:09.092
"This is the end!" cried Toad.

3
00:00:09.093 --> 00:00:11.371
"I am finished!

4
00:00:11.372 --> 00:00:16.110
I will be here forever."

5
00:00:16.111 --> 00:00:19.547
The room was dark with shadows.

6
00:00:19.548 --> 00:00:24.004
Water dripped: plink, plunk

7
00:00:24.005 --> 00:00:28.362
. Creepy bugs crawled across the

8
00:00:28.363 --> 00:00:32.148
stones. Toad jumped up and brushed his

9
00:00:32.149 --> 00:00:35.396
coat. Toad shook the bars in the

10
00:00:35.397 --> 00:00:39.805
door. "I was so stupid!" he

11
00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:43.624
yelled. "Why didn’t I listen to Rat and

12
00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:49.412
Mole? Oh Badger, you were so

13
00:00:49.413 --> 00:00:53.448
wise!" The jailer’s daughter brought Toad his

14
00:00:53.449 --> 00:00:58.331
meals. But Toad did not

15
00:00:58.332 --> 00:01:07.981
eat. For days, he cried in the corner of his

16
00:01:07.982 --> 00:01:13.445
room. The jailer’s daughter went to her

17
00:01:13.446 --> 00:01:17.289
father. "Toad is so unhappy!" she said.

18
00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:20.355
"He’s getting very thin!"

19
00:01:20.356 --> 00:01:25.862
"My girl," said the jailer, "he’s a criminal.

20
00:01:25.863 --> 00:01:28.900
You don’t have to care for him."

21
00:01:28.901 --> 00:01:32.211
"He needs to eat!" she cried.

22
00:01:32.212 --> 00:01:35.380
"I’ll make him a tasty meal."

23
00:01:35.381 --> 00:01:39.238
"Do what you like," said her father.

24
00:01:39.239 --> 00:01:44.967
"I’m tired of hearing him moan."

25
00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:48.298
The daughter knocked on Toad’s door.

26
00:01:48.299 --> 00:01:51.499
"Go away!" cried Toad.

27
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:56.722
"Stop crying," she said, and unlocked the door.

28
00:01:56.723 --> 00:01:59.844
"I’ve brought you some dinner."

29
00:01:59.845 --> 00:02:04.180
Toad smelled the food and lifted his head.

30
00:02:04.181 --> 00:02:08.844
Then he remembered how angry he was.

31
00:02:08.845 --> 00:02:12.079
"Leave me alone!" Toad yelled.

32
00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:21.722
He cried by himself for the rest of the night.

